Witness installer sources
=========================

installer/witness.nsi, installer/utils.nsh and installer/English.nsh are
derived from the NSIS installer template of the Tauri bundler
(tauri-apps/tauri, crates/tauri-bundler/src/bundle/windows/nsis/), as
generated by @tauri-apps/cli 2.11.4 for Witness v0.2.1. The unmodified
generated output is kept in installer/reference/ (see PROVENANCE.md there).

